WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.733 --> 00:00:01.734
-Hey, everyone.

00:00:01.734 --> 00:00:03.669
Let's get to some
thank-you notes.

00:00:03.669 --> 00:00:04.771
How about that?
James, could I get some

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:05.872
thank-you note writing music,
please?

00:00:05.872 --> 00:00:08.475
[ Playing tender tune ]

00:00:08.475 --> 00:00:10.610
Thanks, man.

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:12.178
Wow.
[ Chuckle ]

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:14.413
♪♪

00:00:14.413 --> 00:00:17.750
Thank you, Jonathan Swan
interviewing Trump,

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:19.351
for lookin' like someone
who just started

00:00:19.351 --> 00:00:21.821
watching "Westworld"
in the middle of Season 3.

00:00:21.821 --> 00:00:24.391
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.027 --> 00:00:30.063
♪♪
[ Chuckle ] Thank you,

00:00:30.063 --> 00:00:33.199
Disney charging $30
to stream "Mulan,"

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:35.701 line:0%
or, as parents put it,
"No way! That's outrageous!

00:00:35.701 --> 00:00:38.437 line:0%
[ Sigh ] Okay, fine."

00:00:38.437 --> 00:00:39.806 line:0%
-[ Grumbles ]
-[ Grumbles ]

00:00:42.708 --> 00:00:44.576
♪♪
Thank you,

00:00:44.576 --> 00:00:47.280
Smartfood
Crunch Berries popcorn,

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:50.383
for really testing the limits
of the words smart and food.

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:52.285
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.285 --> 00:00:53.786
-[ Chuckle ]

00:00:53.786 --> 00:00:56.756
-Crunch Berries?
-Yeah.

00:00:56.756 --> 00:00:57.890
♪♪

00:00:57.890 --> 00:01:00.559
[ Laughter ]
-Thank you, Men's Wearhouse,

00:01:00.559 --> 00:01:02.362
for declaring bankruptcy.

00:01:02.362 --> 00:01:03.629
Nobody likes that.

00:01:03.629 --> 00:01:04.864
"I guarantee it."

00:01:04.864 --> 00:01:07.132
-Aw!

00:01:07.132 --> 00:01:08.468
-Too soon.

00:01:08.468 --> 00:01:10.269
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.269 --> 00:01:13.572
Too soon!
-Too soon.

00:01:13.572 --> 00:01:15.441
♪♪
Thank you,

00:01:15.441 --> 00:01:18.444
Pillsbury's new
Snackable Cookie Dough Bites,

00:01:18.444 --> 00:01:20.146
for being a great way
to silently tell

00:01:20.146 --> 00:01:23.049
the grocery store cashier
that 2020 has beaten you.

00:01:23.049 --> 00:01:24.383
[ Laughter ]
There you go, everyone,

00:01:24.383 --> 00:01:25.585
those are my thank-you notes!

